    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Thomas Byrne Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this superb gable-end ground-floor apartment, beautifully set within the prestigious Grange Rath estate.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light, this well-maintained home offers a warm and welcoming ambiance. The living spaces comprises: entrance hall with a cloakroom, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, separate kitchen, two double bedrooms (master en-suite), and bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property adjoins picturesque, mature woodlands and private communal gardens. Excellent transport links, vibrant shopping amenities, local beaches, and Dublin Airport less than 25 minutes away."
      },
